        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium perborate, monohydrate, powder, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium perborate, monohydrate, powder, at plant
data based on a study, performed by EMPA and Boustead Consulting;
CAS number: 007632-04-4; 
UUID: 475c916f-6080-33fb-ab55-6370a4c5fdb0
This module contains material and energy input for the production of perborates out of borax, NaOH and hydrogen peoroxide. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology used from these European producers
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: company data used for average  
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_475c916f-6080-33fb-ab55-6370a4c5fdb0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
